---
import { caseStudyCopy } from '@/config/case-studies';
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const caseCopy = caseStudyCopy.miaoda;
---

<BaseLayout title="妙搭支持专家模式" description="承接专业开发，让简单体验不变复杂" closing={false}>
  <article class="case-media-hover miaoda-paper">
    <div class="[font-synthesis:none] wrap-anywhere antialiased text-xs/4">
      <div class="overflow-clip bg-[#FAFAF7]">
        <div class="w-full max-w-7xl px-10 mx-auto case-header">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-start w-full">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
              <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                <div class="items-center flex gap-2 self-stretch case-header-breadcrumb rise">
                  <div>
                    <a
                      href="/"
                      aria-label="返回作品集首页"
                      class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4"
                    >
                      作品案例
                    </a>
                  </div>
                  <div >
                    /
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <div aria-current="page">
                      {caseCopy.title}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-[65.376px] [letter-spacing:-2.28816px] leading-[115%] text-balance self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#121211] case-header-title rise" style="--rise-step: 2">
                  承接专业开发，让简单体验不变复杂
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[21.792px] leading-[185%] text-pretty self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#3B3B38] case-header-intro rise" style="--rise-step: 3">
                {caseCopy.description}
              </div>
            </div>
            <dl class="flex py-8 gap-10 flex-wrap items-start [align-content:start] justify-between self-stretch border-t border-t-solid border-b border-b-solid border-y-[#E6E5DF] w-full case-header-meta rise" style="--rise-step: 4">
              <div class="flex-1">
                <dt>
                  设计范围
                </dt>
                <dd>
                  妙搭产品框架及任务、数据、发布与扩展能力的 UX 设计
                </dd>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <dt>
                  方案成果
                </dt>
                <dd>
                  守住简单路径，建立进阶路径：专业操作不成为日常必经步骤，复杂需求有对应的操作入口与流程
                </dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
            <div class="self-stretch mt-16">
              <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-clip bg-white">
                <div
                  class="aspect-[auto_3200/2000] w-full max-w-full overflow-clip bg-size-[100%_100%] bg-position-[50%] bg-no-repeat"
                  data-placeholder
                  aria-label="界面示意图待补充"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="text-[14px] leading-[180%] mt-4 text-center font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#6A6964]">
                以熟悉的对话与应用工作区为基础，按需扩展专业开发能力
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-7xl pt-32 flex flex-col gap-12 px-10 mx-auto">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-5 w-fit">
            <div class="items-center flex gap-2.5 self-stretch">
              <div class="shrink-0 rounded-[50%] [box-shadow:#1212112E_0px_0px_0px_1px] bg-[#D4F84A] size-1.75" />
              <div class="inline-block tracking-[0.78px] wrap-break-word uppercase text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#6A6964] text-[13px]/4">
                01 / 项目背景
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-[48px] [letter-spacing:-1.2px] leading-[150%] max-w-275 text-balance self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium whitespace-pre-wrap text-[#121211]">
              产品走向整合，
              <br />
              用户的开发路径也需要连续
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-7 self-stretch">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-12 self-stretch">
              <div class="w-full flex flex-col gap-1">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3 self-stretch">
                  <div class="text-[16px] leading-[160%] text-balance max-w-full shrink-0 font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#121211]">
                    公司侧：更有效地做产品、卖产品
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-[14px] leading-[180%] text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#6A6964]">
                  统一品牌与商业化，减少重复的底层建设，推动能力复用，并降低两条产品线之间的组织协同成本
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full flex flex-col gap-1">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3 self-stretch">
                  <div class="text-[16px] leading-[160%] text-balance max-w-full shrink-0 font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#121211]">
                    用户侧：同一个产品，从简单走向专业
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-[14px] leading-[180%] text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#6A6964]">
                  先用简单对话开始，后续需要异步任务、开发与生产数据隔离等能力时，仍能在同一个应用里继续，而不用换到另一款产品
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl flex flex-col gap-5 self-stretch p-6 bg-[#F2F2ED]">
              <div class="items-center flex flex-wrap gap-4 content-center">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    data-case-tab
                    class="min-h-11 text-center content-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-[999px] bg-[#D4F84A] border border-solid border-[#D4F84A]"
                  >
                    <div class="text-[14px] leading-[160%] text-center font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#121211]">
                      飞书妙搭
                    </div>
                  </button>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    data-case-tab
                    class="min-h-11 text-center content-center py-1.5 px-3 rounded-[999px] border border-solid border-[#D3D2CA]"
                  >
                    <div class="text-[14px] leading-[160%] text-center font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#121211]">
                      飞书 aPaaS
                    </div>
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[13px] leading-[180%] self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] whitespace-pre-wrap text-[#6A6964]">
                目标用户：业务人员、产品、运营、数字化负责人，以及没有深厚编程基础、但能说清业务需求的人
                <br />
                产品定位：AI 驱动的应用开发平台，以自然语言描述需求，由 AI 生成并持续修改应用
              </div>
              <div class="flex text-center items-start gap-2.75 self-stretch">
                <div
                  class="case-hover-image h-89 rounded-lg w-142.5 shrink-0 bg-cover bg-position-[50%] [outline:0.5px_solid_#D3D2CA4D]"
                  style="background-image: url(https://app.paper.design/file-assets/01M60NJ1NA6E6NVB2WBNE0FK0V/01M71E4YMTF0ZKW7E87006KX2R.png)"
                />
                <div
                  class="case-hover-image h-89 rounded-lg w-142.5 shrink-0 bg-cover bg-position-[50%] [outline:0.5px_solid_#D3D2CA4D]"
                  style="background-image: url(https://app.paper.design/file-assets/01M60NJ1NA6E6NVB2WBNE0FK0V/01M71E3T72ZPE7PYJ9NM1P5762.png)"
                />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-7xl pt-32 pb-20 px-10 mx-auto">
          <div class="items-center flex mb-5 gap-2.5">
            <div class="shrink-0 rounded-[50%] [box-shadow:#1212112E_0px_0px_0px_1px] bg-[#D4F84A] size-1.75" />
            <div class="inline-block tracking-[0.78px] wrap-break-word uppercase text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#6A6964] text-[13px]/4">
              02 / 设计目标
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[48px] [letter-spacing:-1.2px] leading-[150%] mb-6 max-w-275 text-balance font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium whitespace-pre-wrap text-[#121211]">
            专业用户用得起来，
            <br />
            普通用户仍然用得简单
          </div>
          <div class="text-[18px] leading-[190%] max-w-225 text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#3B3B38]">
            在既定整合战略下，设计需要解决两类体验风险：专业能力接入后抬高日常使用门槛，以及进阶需求出现时缺少清晰的操作路径
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(2,minmax(0px,1fr))] mt-12 gap-5.5">
            <div class="p-6.5 rounded-[22px] bg-white border border-solid border-[#E6E5DF]">
              <div class="text-[22px] mb-3 leading-[160%] text-balance wrap-normal font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#121211]">
                守住简单路径
              </div>
              <div class="text-[17px] leading-[180%] mt-2.5 wrap-break-word text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#3B3B38]">
                保留熟悉的应用框架，让“说需求 → 看效果 → 修改 → 发布”不增加非必要步骤和概念
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6.5 rounded-[22px] bg-white border border-solid border-[#E6E5DF]">
              <div class="text-[22px] mb-3 leading-[160%] text-balance wrap-normal font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#121211]">
                建立进阶路径
              </div>
              <div class="text-[17px] leading-[180%] mt-2.5 wrap-break-word text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#3B3B38]">
                当并行开发、多人协作、数据隔离或外部集成需求出现时，提供可发现、可理解、可完成的操作路径
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full bg-[#0E0E0C]">
          <div class="w-full max-w-7xl py-24 px-10 mx-auto">
            <div class="items-center flex mb-5 gap-2.5">
              <div class="shrink-0 rounded-[50%] [box-shadow:#525252_0px_0px_0px_1px] bg-[#D4F84A] size-1.75" />
              <div class="inline-block tracking-[0.78px] wrap-break-word uppercase text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#C7C7BF] text-[13px]/4">
                03 / 守住简单路径
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-[48px] [letter-spacing:-1.2px] leading-[130%] mb-6 max-w-275 text-balance font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium whitespace-pre-wrap text-[#F4F3EE]">
              能力向专业扩展，
              <br />
              开发仍从熟悉的地方开始
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-12">
              <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2.5 flex-1">
                <div class="text-[16px] leading-[145%] text-balance wrap-normal self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Semibold','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[#F4F3EE]">
                  设计挑战
                </div>
                <div class="text-[14px] leading-[190%] max-w-225 text-pretty self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#C7C7BF]">
                  整合不仅要承接专业能力，也要避免把原 4.0
                  的界面和操作逻辑直接搬进妙搭，让用户为了继续开发，被迫学习一套新的工具
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2.5 flex-1">
                <div class="text-[16px] leading-[145%] text-balance wrap-normal self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Semibold','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-semibold text-[#F4F3EE]">
                  设计策略
                </div>
                <div class="text-[14px] leading-[190%] max-w-225 text-pretty self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] whitespace-pre-wrap text-[#C7C7BF]">
                  • 保持妙搭站点框架，仅在入口侧提供pro按钮及功能说明
                  <br />• 专业开发能力均以妙搭应用开发界面为基础扩展
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#1C1C1A]">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap mb-6 gap-2">
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-case-tab
                  class="min-h-11 text-center content-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-[99px] bg-[#D4F84A] border border-solid border-[#D4F84A]"
                >
                  <div class="text-[14px] leading-[140%] text-center font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#121211]">
                    保持妙搭站点框架
                  </div>
                </button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-case-tab
                  class="min-h-11 text-center content-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-[99px] border border-solid border-[#55554F]"
                >
                  <div class="text-[14px] leading-[140%] text-center font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#D4D4CC]">
                    专业能力扩展
                  </div>
                </button>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div>
                  <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-clip bg-white">
                    <div
                      class="aspect-[auto_3200/2000] w-full max-w-full overflow-clip bg-size-[100%_100%] bg-position-[50%] bg-no-repeat"
                      data-placeholder
                      aria-label="界面示意图待补充"
                    />
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-[14px] leading-[180%] mt-4 text-center font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#C7C7BF]">
                    入口只增加 PRO 按钮和功能说明，不替换用户熟悉的站点组织与开发起点
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2 pt-14">
              <div class="text-[16px] leading-[145%] text-balance wrap-normal self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#D4F84A]">
                设计结果
              </div>
              <div class="text-[24px] leading-[170%] text-pretty self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#F4F3EE]">
                专业能力融入已有产品框架，用户仍沿用熟悉的开发路径：说需求 → 看效果 → 修改 → 发布
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-7xl pt-32 px-10 mx-auto">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-start w-full gap-12">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-5">
              <div class="items-center flex gap-2.5 self-stretch">
                <div class="shrink-0 rounded-[50%] [box-shadow:#1212112E_0px_0px_0px_1px] bg-[#D4F84A] size-1.75" />
                <div class="inline-block tracking-[0.78px] wrap-break-word uppercase text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#6A6964] text-[13px]/4">
                  04 / 建立进阶路径
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[48px] [letter-spacing:-1.2px] leading-[150%] max-w-275 text-balance self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium whitespace-pre-wrap text-[#121211]">
                按场景引入复杂度，
                <br />
                而不是一次展示所有专业能力
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-5 self-stretch">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl flex-1 p-10 bg-[#F2F2ED]">
                <div class="text-balance tracking-[0.08em] self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#121211] text-xl/5">
                  设计挑战
                </div>
                <div class="self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#3B3B38] text-lg/8.5">
                  如果用户刚开始开发，就要选择任务、迭代和数据库环境，会把学习成本放在用户还没理解价值的时候，也不符合实际操作动线
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl flex-1 p-10 bg-[#F2F2ED]">
                <div class="text-balance tracking-[0.08em] self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#121211] text-xl/5">
                  设计策略
                </div>
                <div class="self-stretch font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#3B3B38] text-lg/8.5">
                  以共同的简单开发路径为基础，围绕并行开发、多人协作、数据安全和外部集成场景，逐步展开进阶操作
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="scroll-mbs-25 scroll-mt-25 py-16">
              <div>
                <div class="text-[13px] tracking-[0.78px] leading-[185%] mb-4 max-w-225 wrap-break-word text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#6A6964]">
                  进阶路径 1 · 想同时处理另一件事
                </div>
                <div class="text-[34px] [letter-spacing:-0.68px] leading-[140%] mb-3 text-balance wrap-normal font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#121211]">
                  从等待执行，到并行推进
                </div>
                <div class="text-[17px] leading-[185%] max-w-225 text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#3B3B38] my-3">
                  在用户有进行中任务时，输入框提示可以作为新任务执行；消息队列中提供新建任务引导。在对话与应用工作区旁增加任务导航，支持查看状态、切换任务和继续对话
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F2F2ED]">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap mb-6 gap-2">
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    data-case-tab
                    class="min-h-11 text-center content-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-[99px] bg-[#D4F84A] border border-solid border-[#D4F84A]"
                  >
                    <div class="text-[14px] leading-[140%] text-center wrap-normal font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#121211]">
                      消息队列引导
                    </div>
                  </button>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    data-case-tab
                    class="min-h-11 text-center content-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-[99px] border border-solid border-[#D3D2CA]"
                  >
                    <div class="text-[14px] leading-[140%] text-center wrap-normal font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#121211]">
                      任务导航
                    </div>
                  </button>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-clip bg-white">
                      <div
                        class="aspect-[auto_3200/2000] w-full max-w-full overflow-clip bg-size-[100%_100%] bg-position-[50%] bg-no-repeat"
                        data-placeholder
                        aria-label="界面示意图待补充"
                      />
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-[14px] leading-[180%] mt-4 text-center wrap-normal font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#3B3B38]">
                      待执行消息里提供转为并行任务的入口
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="scroll-mbs-25 scroll-mt-25 py-16">
              <div>
                <div class="text-[13px] tracking-[0.78px] leading-[185%] mb-4 max-w-225 wrap-break-word text-pretty font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#6A6964]">
                  进阶路径 2 · 多人协作下，明确修改与发布版本
                </div>
                <div class="text-[34px] [letter-spacing:-0.68px] leading-[140%] mb-3 text-balance wrap-normal font-['PingFangSC-Medium','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] font-medium text-[#121211]">
                  支持独立开发，也说清哪一版走向线上
                </div>
                <div class="text-[17px] leading-[160%] text-pretty max-w-full font-['PingFangSC-Regular','PingFang_SC',system-ui,sans-serif] whitespace-pre-wrap text-[#3B3B38]">
                  <span class="text-[#ADADA9]">• </span>支持独立分支来协作开发和统一管理
                  <br />
                  <span class="text-[#ADADA9]">• </span>
                  发布时，支持查看发布分支，支持查看发布详情（含代码变更、环境变量设置等）
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F2F2ED]">
